<%- include('partials/head', { title }) %>
<section class="page-heading">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">关系不是装饰</p><h1>实践关系图谱</h1><p>目标、项目、决策、证据、风险与规则使用稳定 ID 连接。图形用于发现结构，事实仍由数据库约束。</p></div>
</section>

<section class="graph-layout">
  <article class="panel graph-panel">
    <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">当前结构</p><h2><%= graph.nodes.length %> 个节点 · <%= graph.edges.length %> 条关系</h2></div></div>
    <div id="graph-canvas" class="graph-canvas" role="img" aria-label="目标、项目与决策关系图"></div>
  </article>
  <aside class="panel graph-legend">
    <h2>图例</h2>
    <ul class="clean-list">
      <li><span class="node-dot objective"></span><strong>目标</strong></li>
      <li><span class="node-dot project"></span><strong>项目</strong></li>
      <li><span class="node-dot decision"></span><strong>决策</strong></li>
      <li><span class="node-dot evidence"></span><strong>证据</strong></li>
      <li><span class="node-dot risk"></span><strong>风险</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="empty">当前先显示结构和方向。后续 GUI 会增加筛选、路径追踪、影响分析与证据强度。</p>
  </aside>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
